  "title": "Refrigerator Pickled Carrots",
  "description": "Pickled carrots will tickle their taste buds when you bring these easy treats to your next gathering. Just simmer some baby carrots, chill in a sweet and tangy syrup, and serve.",
  "authors": [
    "Marilyn Woodard Thompson"
  ],
